# KIRI PROJECT — ENVIRONMENT TEMPLATE
#
# The app is fully local: records live in localStorage, uploaded files in
# IndexedDB. There are no backend credentials to configure and no secrets are
# required, so copying this file to .env is optional.
#
# Do NOT re-add VITE_SUPABASE_* — the Supabase client was removed. See
# src/lib/localStore.ts (records) and src/lib/idb.ts (files).
